The portfolio view must display the calculated total value and total profit/loss based on current market prices and the user's portfolio data.

Required Elements:

An element with data-testid="portfolio-total-value".
An element with data-testid="portfolio-pl" (Profit/Loss).
Behavior:

These elements must display numerical values calculated from the data in localStorage and the current prices from the WebSocket stream.
