Manually set localStorage with a known portfolio (e.g., 2 BTC bought at $20,000).
Get the current price of BTC from the UI (from data-testid="price-BTCUSDT").
Calculate the expected total value (2 * current price) and P/L (2 * (current price - 20000)).
Check the text content of data-testid="portfolio-total-value" and verify it matches the expected total value (within a small tolerance for formatting).
Check the text content of data-testid="portfolio-pl" and verify it matches the expected P/L.
